strings.messagetemplate_help:
A notification message is sent to subscribers once the notification threshold has been reached. It can include any or all of the following placeholders:

* Link to the location of the event {link}
* Link to the area monitored {modulelink}
* Name of the course module {modulename}
* Rule name {rulename}
* Description {description}
* Event {eventname}
* Full name of the course {coursefullname}
* Short name of the course {courseshortname}
